      "player": "G31FL Pessim",
      "type": "blunder",
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "At 7 life facing a 5/5 animated Aether Spellbomb that will attack next turn, Pessim passed instead of casting Weight of Conscience to lock it down. Another unblocked attack from the 5/5 would put them at 2 life or dead with any additional damage. Weight of Conscience was castable with the untapped Plains and Mountain.",
