      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Weight of Conscience was placed on the animated Aether Spellbomb, which the opponent can sacrifice at any time (for {1} to draw a card or {U} to bounce a creature), wasting the enchantment entirely. The 5/5 body only exists because of Skilled Animator.",
