      "description": "Blocked Skilled Animator (1/3) with King of the Pride (2/1), which kills King of the Pride without killing the Animator. This sacrifices a valuable Cat lord for only 1 point of damage prevention. King of the Pride has strong synergy with Basri's Acolyte in hand (both are Cats), and at 7 life, taking 1 damage is negligible.",
